@startuml
title TradingBot - Package diagram (dependency direction)

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

package composition
package config
package scheduling
package orchestration
package strategies
package risk
package brokers

composition ..> config
composition ..> brokers
composition ..> risk
composition ..> strategies
composition ..> orchestration
composition ..> scheduling

scheduling ..> orchestration

orchestration ..> brokers
orchestration ..> risk
orchestration ..> strategies
orchestration ..> config

risk ..> strategies
risk ..> orchestration

strategies ..> orchestration

brokers ..> config

note right of composition
Composition root:
Only place where concrete implementations
are chosen and assembled.
end note

note right of orchestration
IO boundary enforced here:
Orchestrator is the only broker caller.
end note

@enduml
